{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-23T11:55:14.460Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"6fe7ba654eae068ba842efbc","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.330","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-x9r2h3"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"pm validate reports nothing for a stored custom field definition the runtime registry drops, such as cli_flag '--' or a blank alias"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Raised by the Codex review of PR #1772 (2026-11-23, third pass). The runtime field registry (normalizeRuntimeFieldDefinition in src/core/schema/runtime-schema.ts) returns null for a definition whose cli_flag normalizes to an empty token, an invalid value_schema or an empty key, and drops a blank alias. pm validate --check-metadata scans the resolved registry (scanFieldOptionCollisions in src/sdk/schema/field-option-collisions.ts), so such a stored definition is invisible: the field silently stops working and nothing tells the operator. PR #1772 closes the write paths (add-field, profile apply, rename-field and mutateWorkspaceSettings refuse an empty spelling with schema_field_flag_invalid), but definitions already stored inline or in schema/fields.json stay unreported. Duplicate check: searched validate dropped field definition empty cli_flag registry; pm-8patuh (closed) owns spelling refusals at write time."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:schema","diagnostics","validation"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-23T11:55:14.460Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-23T11:55:14.460Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":60},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"validate --check-metadata reports every stored field definition the registry drops, with the key, the source (inline settings or schema/fields.json) and the reason; A blank or empty-normalizing alias is reported even though the definition itself resolves; A spec seeds each dropped shape and asserts the validate rows, with a negative control on the current release"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-8jdc"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A stored definition that the registry drops or truncates is named by validate with a repair hint"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-8patuh","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-11-23T11:55:14.460Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"e512dd779ae3c5b4f11d475094b687bb130aa9ea1493f999a9f71f9ababe8f60","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"c07b7901cb6ed2aed9441e8a145f6bb6ea88e4ede60ed1166a1880d079e59d52"}
